# Normalise line endings in the repository and check them out as LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows checks text files out as CRLF
# while the committed blobs are LF. Prettier's default `endOfLine: 'lf'` then
# fails `bun run check` on a fresh checkout, even though CI - which checks out
# LF - is green. Pinning the working tree to LF makes the local and CI
# formatting gates agree.
* text=auto eol=lf
